WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.728
Use Cart Value Rewards when the offer depends on
eligible spending, not the quantity on a product line.

2
00:00:06.728 --> 00:00:13.457
In a new Tiered discount campaign, choose that trigger
in Conditions. Our example is ten percent from fifty

3
00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:20.185
U.S. dollars. Enter the minimum in Rewards. A blank
maximum leaves this tier without an upper spend bound;

4
00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:23.175
it does not set a maximum discount benefit.

5
00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:30.639
Open Currency-specific thresholds and add Canadian
dollars. Enter seventy as the CAD minimum while

6
00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:37.510
keeping fifty as the USD base. These are independently
chosen business amounts, not automatic exchange-rate

7
00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:43.465
conversion. The current form explains that
unconfigured currencies do not qualify. Repeat the

8
00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:49.420
configuration for every currency and tier you
advertise, and check any separate campaign-wide

9
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.253
minimum overrides as well.

10
00:00:52.303 --> 00:00:58.833
Review the offer, save it inactive, then reopen
Rewards. Expand the currency section and check USD

11
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:05.364
fifty, CAD seventy and the ten-percent rate. Closing
an advanced section does not erase its values.

12
00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:11.895
Currency controls the amount comparison; it does not
select an audience country or guarantee a shipping

13
00:01:11.895 --> 00:01:18.017
rate. This recording verifies persistence, not a live
market switch or a new checkout test.

14
00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:27.003
Before launch, test one cent below, exactly at and
above each threshold in the cart's actual currency.

15
00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:33.072
Compare eligible merchandise rather than tax, shipping
or compare-at prices. Exclusions and gift-counting

16
00:01:33.072 --> 00:01:40.541
settings can change what qualifies. Apply the actual
intended discount code and recheck totals; do not

17
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:46.609
assume every discount affects qualification
identically. If you add free shipping, verify delivery

18
00:01:46.609 --> 00:01:52.678
rates separately. Keep theme progress messages
consistent with the same thresholds and restrictions.
